        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Donovan, Lewis Preston\n- Organizations: Oklahoma City Thunder, Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, University of Notre Dame, University of Florida, NBA\n- Events: 2015–16 Oklahoma City Thunder season\n- Roles: Head coach, assistant men's basketball coach\n\nFacts:\n- After missing the playoffs in the previous season, the Oklahoma City Thunder won the Northwest Division and clinched the third seed in the Western Conference during the 2015–16 season.\n- William John Donovan Jr. was born on May 30, 1965.\n- Billy Donovan is an American professional basketball coach.\n- Billy Donovan was the head coach of the Oklahoma City Thunder in the NBA.\n- Lewis Preston previously served as an assistant men's basketball coach at Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, and the University of Notre Dame.\n- Lewis Preston also served as an assistant men's basketball coach under Billy Donovan at the University of Florida.",
